 preparedness]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/imd-launches-webgis-based-decision-support-system-to-improve-cyclone-disaster-preparedness/articleshow/135039125.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135039125.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The India Meteorological Department has launched an advanced WebGIS platform designed to boost disaster preparedness against cyclones. This Decision Support System will deliver vital cyclone alerts and marine weather updates to various stakeholders. By enhancing public awareness of the risks and effects associated with severe weather, it aims to further curtail cyclone-related fatalities, which have dropped dramatically in recent years.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/imd-launches-webgis-based-decision-support-system-to-improve-cyclone-disaster-preparedness/articleshow/135039125.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/imd-launches-webgis-based-decision-support-system-to-improve-cyclone-disaster-preparedness/articleshow/135039125.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T09:25:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vishwa Mohan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135039206,imgsize-96979.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SIT files 1000-page chargesheet in Kishtwar teen’s rape and abortion death]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sit-files-1000-page-chargesheet-in-kishtwar-teens-rape-and-abortion-death/articleshow/135037839.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135037839.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sit-files-1000-page-chargesheet-in-kis